<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρενικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρρην</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>male,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωμάτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					37i7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
					121.522
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				16.1
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλυκός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.872.5
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cumae</span>): less 
				Att.
			 form 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρσενικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				38.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.115
			</span></i> (Marc. Arg.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβανον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.906
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβανος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>virile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				11.18
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <i>of masculine gender,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1011c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτῶσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.294
				</span></i>
			; (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρσ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				634.17
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλυκῶς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.590b
			</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρσ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.11
			</span></i>.</div>
